{"id":"vod_md_4095","vodId":"4095","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"结城友奈是勇者","name_cn":"结城友奈是勇者","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230903-1/4ccf19144a4c3b44b418cefda0e9febe.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在神世纪300年，表面看来，结城友奈（照井春佳 配音）是一个平凡的初中二年级女生，个性开朗热情的她是校园中的活跃分子，深受老师和朋友们的喜爱。可实际上，放课后的她还有着另一重身份——勇者部的部员。友奈的邻居兼好友，沉默寡言却意外的温柔的东乡美森（三森铃子 配音）、个性大大咧咧果断直率，却意外的擅长做家务的犬吠埼风（内山夕实 配音）、风的妹妹，像小动物一样惹人怜爱的犬吠埼树（黑泽朋世 配音）、看似桀骜不驯难以接近，实际上非常害羞傲娇的三好夏凛（长妻树里 配音），除了友奈，活跃在勇者部的是这些性格迥异的女孩们，她们所要面对的，是名为巴提克的强大敌人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-03 10:18:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/UbSf9Rx5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/GinVmOUO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/XNyRRS5H/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/Duv8nyQH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/TMg4EbLc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/ZWR9WUwJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/INCedteg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/PA1OMR1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/1gjs0uuD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/ppay4Nur/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/D9pVXpIN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/L2HQvvXz/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:55.750Z"}